    "body": "`PyTuple_GetSlice()` in `atexit_register()` returns a new reference that was never decref'd, leaking a tuple on every `atexit.register()` call.\n\nAlso added a missing NULL check after `PyTuple_GetSlice()`.\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-144986 -->\n* Issue: gh-144986\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n",
